  "description": "At thirty‑one, Sol Kim is a mystery novelist with two books, no audience, and a growing fear that her dreams are already over. Her worst doubts are confirmed when her book signing draws not a single fan. Just as Sol hits her lowest point, she crosses paths with Nara Kang, an eccentric former classmate who claims to be her biggest fan. Na-Ra believes in magic, runs a toy shop called “Wonderland” filled with whimsy, and refuses to let Sol retreat into isolation. In Wonderland, Sol finds comfort she never expected and a friendship she did not know she needed. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
